          "email": "adilger@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-09-30 17:35:43.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-20855 tests: restore ROOT default LMV in sanity/65n",
        "message": "LU-20855 tests: restore ROOT default LMV in sanity/65n\n\nsanity test_65n saves the default LMV of the root directory by its\nstripe count, index and hash type.  The default LMV that the MDT\nsets on the root directory has no hash type, so test_65n deletes it\ninstead of restoring it at exit, and later subtests no longer get\nnew directories spread over the MDTs by its max-inherit-rr.  Then\nsanity test_413d fails with \"400 subdirs on MDT0\" on a DNE system.\n\nCheck for a default LMV by its stripe count, and restore its\nmax-inherit as well, its max-inherit-rr if it has no fixed MDT index,\nand its hash type only if it has one.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 3e04b0fd6c3d (\"LU-13417 mdd: set default LMV on ROOT\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5.5 ltvm,llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I91bd016b433aeb0f346593fc567be921463ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
